  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Keys in the lakehouse are logical",
      "items": [
        "Iceberg enforces no foreign keys; dashed links are join keys",
        "Silver primary keys are the Iceberg identifier fields that Flink upserts on (ADR 0011)",
        "created_at and status_ts are in the stored keys only because Iceberg upserts need the partition column"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not shown",
      "items": [
        "Bronze keeps the raw rows: gps_pings, orders_cdc, vans_cdc, depots_cdc (Debezium envelopes) and dlq_events",
        "dest_lat and dest_lon are personal data: read-restricted, never copied to gold (NFR-6)"
      ]
    }
  ]
